      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Milīmo Ya Bagabīji",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi hamò na bataale ba mabità ga bashilikale būsolanhya banhū bamò kūfuma mu shibyalīlwe sha ba Asafu, Hema, na Yedusuni gīkī babize na nīmo gwa kūfunya būhangi kūnū bakūtūlaga ndono, malimba na nzege. Abo bakasolwa kūgwīta ū nīmo gwenūyo baalī aba: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Asafu būsolwa bitūnja bakwe: Zakuuli, Yosefu, Netania na Asalela. Ū Asafu walī ntongeeji wabo a bitūnja bakwe, nū kūhanga wahangaga wei kūlondeela kahelele ka ntemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yudusuni a bitūnja bakwe baalī: Gedalia, Zeli, Yeshaya, Shimei, Hashabia, na Maatisia; a bose banhū batandatū ha sīlīlī ya būtongeeji wa ng'wa saabo Yudusuni, ūyo wahaganga na kūnkumīlīja ū Seeba kūnū akūtūlaga ndono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hemani a bitūnja bakwe baalī: Buukia, Maatania, Uzieli, Shubaeli, Yelimoti, Hanania, Hanani, Eliasa, Gidalati, na Lomamitī-eza, Yoshibekasha, Maloti, Hotili, na Mahazioti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bose benaba baalī bitūnja ba ng'wa Hemani, ūyo walī ng'hangi wa ntemi. Ū Mulungu walī wang'wisagīja ū Hemani gīkī akūngūngūhya, na lūūlū ūng'winha bitūnja ikūmi na banè na bashīke badatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū saabo walī ntongeeji wabo pye a benaba ūlū bakwīmbaga mu hekalu ya ng'wa Seeba, nūūlū ng'wikanza lya kūlamya kūnū bakūtūlaga nzege, malimba, na ndono ū mu numba ya ng'wa Mulungu. Ū Asafu nū Yudusuni nū Hemani, balondeelaga kahelele ka ntemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lisaabu lyabo a bose, ū kūbasanja na a badūgū babo, baalī banhū magana abīlī na makūmi anaane na banaane; hama pye a bose baalī balangilwe kwīmba chiza ū kū būtongi wa ng'wa Seeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pyī ūmo bagelelile, babize bataale nūūlū bado, balangi nūūlū balangwa; būlī ng'wene watūlīgījiagwa mbale hū wingīla ū mu nīmo ūyo wagwītaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mbale ya kwandya yalī ya ng'wa Asafu; īkangwīla Yosefu hamò na bitūnja bakwe na badūgū bakwe; banhū ikūmi na babīlī. Ī ya kabīlī yūngwīla Gedalia na bana bakwe na badūgūye; banhū ikūmi na babīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ya kadatū yūngwīla Zakuuli na bana bakwe na badūgūye; banhū ikūmi na babīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ya kanè yūngwīla Izili na baana bakwe na badūgūye; banhū ikūmi na babīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ya katanò yūngwīla Nesania na bana bakwe na badūgūye; banhū ikūmi na babīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ya katandatū yūngwīla Bukia na bana bakwe na badūgūye; banhū ikūmi na babīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ya mpungatī yūngwīla Yesalela na bana bakwe na badūgūye; banhū ikūmi na babīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ya kanaane yūngwīla Yeshaya na bana bakwe na badūgūye; banhū ikūmi na babīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.15",
